{
  "sections": {
    "hero": {
      "type": "landing-hero",
      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "For Every Phase of Your Cycle",
        "heading": "6 Reasons Women Reach for Tiiga During Their <em>Period</em>",
        "text": "<p>That week asks a lot of your body. More water, more minerals, more grace. Tiiga helps you give some of it back with coconut water electrolytes, 5g of gentle baobab prebiotic fiber, and real fruit in one stick you'll actually look forward to.</p>",
        "image_1": "shopify://shop_images/Copy_of_Tiiga.Marketing-HP004.jpg",
        "image_2": "",
        "primary_button_label": "Shop Tiiga",
        "primary_button_link": "shopify://products/organic-baobab-coconut-water-prebiotic-electrolyte-supplement-16-pack-bag",
        "secondary_button_label": "See the 6 Reasons",
        "secondary_button_link": "",
        "rating": "4.7",
        "review_count": "850+ reviews",
        "shipping_note": "1M+ members",
        "disclaimer": "<p>Cancel anytime · 30-day money-back guarantee · These statements have not been evaluated by the FDA.</p>",
        "background_color": "#1d5a6b",
        "text_color": "#ffffff",
        "padding-block-start": 64,
        "padding-block-end": 64,
        "layout": "split"
      }
    },
    "story_rows": {
      "type": "story-rows",
      "blocks": {
        "row_1": {
          "type": "_story-row",
          "settings": {
            "number": "01",
            "eyebrow": "HYDRATION",
            "title": "That Puffy, Heavy Feeling? It's Partly Hydration.",
            "text": "<p>Right before your period, hormone shifts tell your body to hold onto water in all the wrong places while your cells run dry. Plain water doesn't touch it. Tiiga's coconut water electrolytes deliver potassium, magnesium, and sodium that support normal fluid balance, so you feel less puffy and more like yourself.</p>",
            "media_style": "image",
            "media_position": "right",
            "image_1": "shopify://shop_images/IMG_1107_2.jpg",
            "image_2": "",
            "background_color": "#ffffff"
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "row_2": {
          "type": "_story-row",
          "settings": {
            "number": "02",
            "eyebrow": "DIGESTION",
            "title": "Let's Talk About Period Poops.",
            "text": "<p>Nobody warns you that your cycle can take digestion on a rollercoaster. Backed up one day, the complete opposite the next. The 5g of whole-fruit baobab fiber in Tiiga is gentle enough for the sensitive days and helps keep your rhythm steady all month, so your period has one less surprise in store.</p>",
            "media_style": "image",
            "media_position": "left",
            "image_1": "shopify://shop_images/1284685a-5f3f-40f2-9f48-1042a63ff229.png",
            "image_2": "",
            "background_color": "#ffffff"
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "row_3": {
          "type": "_story-row",
          "settings": {
            "number": "03",
            "eyebrow": "ENERGY",
            "title": "Your Energy Dips. Your Iron Does, Too.",
            "text": "<p>Every month you lose iron, and every month the tired can hit harder than it should. Baobab is naturally rich in vitamin C, which helps your body absorb the iron in the food you eat. Paired with real hydration, it supports steady energy on the days you need it most, no caffeine required.</p>",
            "media_style": "image",
            "media_position": "right",
            "image_1": "shopify://shop_images/Copy_of_Tiiga.Marketing-HP040.jpg",
            "image_2": "",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "media_fit": "cover",
            "media_ratio": "portrait"
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "row_4": {
          "type": "_story-row",
          "settings": {
            "number": "04",
            "eyebrow": "MINERALS",
            "title": "The Magnesium Everyone Keeps Telling You About.",
            "text": "<p>If your group chat has ever told you to take magnesium during your period, they're onto something. Magnesium supports normal muscle function and relaxation, and Tiiga delivers magnesium citrate, a well-absorbed form, right alongside the electrolytes your body is already asking for.</p>",
            "media_style": "image",
            "media_position": "left",
            "image_1": "shopify://shop_images/43f77343-153f-4fca-a30b-67bf3fdfa5ec.png",
            "image_2": "",
            "background_color": "#ffffff"
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "row_5": {
          "type": "_story-row",
          "settings": {
            "number": "05",
            "eyebrow": "CRAVINGS",
            "title": "A Sweet Fix That Doesn't Backfire.",
            "text": "<p>When the cravings hit, you don't need willpower, you need better options. Tiiga tastes like real fruit, has zero added sugar, and comes in at 35 calories, so you get the sweet moment without the crash that makes everything else that week feel harder.</p>",
            "media_style": "image",
            "media_position": "right",
            "image_1": "shopify://shop_images/Copy_of_Tiiga.Marketing-HP064.jpg",
            "image_2": "",
            "background_color": "#ffffff"
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "row_6": {
          "type": "_story-row",
          "settings": {
            "number": "06",
            "eyebrow": "LOVED BY 1M+",
            "title": "You're in Good Company.",
            "text": "<p>Tiiga is the top choice for people looking to fill nutrition gaps in a convenient, tasty way, and women are a huge part of that story.</p>",
            "media_style": "checklist",
            "media_position": "right",
            "checklist": "One stick in your bag: no measuring, no clean-up, even on the busiest days\nTastes like real fruit with zero added sugar\nCycle-friendly support: electrolytes for fluid balance, gentle fiber for digestion",
            "background_color": "#1d5a6b",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          },
          "blocks": {}
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "row_1",
        "row_2",
        "row_3",
        "row_4",
        "row_5",
        "row_6"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "",
        "heading": "Made for how your month actually feels",
        "text": "<p>You don't need another pill or another promise. You need to feel like yourself all month. Here's why Tiiga earns its place in your bag.</p>",
        "background_color": "#f6f4f0",
        "padding-block-start": 64,
        "padding-block-end": 64,
        "media_width": "beside"
      }
    },
